abstract: >
  Notebook-first causal inference lab separating reusable Python estimators from
  analysis notebooks. Covers propensity-score adjustment, inverse probability
  weighting, AIPW, matching, double machine learning, difference-in-differences,
  instrumental variables, regression discontinuity, synthetic control,
  heterogeneous treatment effects, bootstrap uncertainty, sensitivity analysis,
  and policy targeting, with synthetic ground-truth data and a benchmark
  Lalonde/NSW replication.
